GIMP Palette
Name: Actual Generators
Columns: 5
# Shared palette for all Actual Generators textures.
# Load in Aseprite: Palette menu > Load Palette. Also readable by Pixelorama,
# LibreSprite, GIMP and Blockbench.
#
# Ten ramps of five shades, dark to light. Light comes from the upper left:
# lightest shade top-left, darkest bottom-right, outline in the ramp's darkest.
# Stay inside these ramps so machines read as one family; add a ramp rather
# than a stray colour.
#
# --- Casing: the default machine chassis ---
 26  29  36	Casing 1
 45  51  62	Casing 2
 66  74  88	Casing 3
 92 102 118	Casing 4
124 136 153	Casing 5
